# Redoland environment template.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and uncomment what you need. The CLI loads
# `.env.local` then `.env` at startup (stdlib loader in redoland/env.py; a variable
# already set in the real environment always wins).
#
# There is NO API key to configure: all inference goes through the `claude -p` CLI
# on its own login, and the model layer deliberately strips ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from
# the child environment. The model is chosen per run with `init --model`.

# Path to the `claude` CLI binary, if it is not on PATH (default: "claude").
#REDOLAND_CLAUDE_BIN=/usr/local/bin/claude
